{
  "name": "Physician's Touch",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can administer even greater cures with a touch, and if you feel it's necessary, you can use your knowledge to cause harm.</p><p>When you use Hand of Healing, you can also end one of the following conditions on the creature you heal or remove one disease affecting them: Blinded, Deafened, Paralyzed, Poisoned, or Stunned.</p><p>When you use Hand of Harm on a creature, you can also force that creature to make a Constitution Saving Throw or have the Poisoned condition until the end of your next turn.</p>",
